{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "fixflux-mifid-reporting",
  "title": "FIXFlux - MiFID II Post-Trade Reporting",
  "description": "reporting-service outcomes and RTS 1 one-minute publication latency, from Prometheus metrics only. No counterparty data (LEIs) is shown.",
  "tags": [
    "fintech",
    "mifid-ii",
    "regulatory",
    "reporting-service"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**reporting-service** writes one regulatory record per trade to `regulatory_reports`. **REPORTABLE**: in scope, all reference data present. **NOT_REPORTABLE**: instrument out of scope. **INCOMPLETE**: missing LEI, instrument data or execution time (flagged, never defaulted). **DUPLICATE**: a redelivered trade absorbed by the unique `trade_id` constraint.\n\nRTS 1 Art. 14(1)(a): publish *within one minute* of execution. Latency here is execution to report creation; nothing is published to an APA. Individual reports: see the SQL in `scripts/demo-mifid-reporting.md`. Counts use `increase()`, so small totals can show as approximate values over very short ranges."
      },
      "id": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Report outcomes (selected time range)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "id": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Reportable",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "0",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(regulatory_reports_total{status=\"REPORTABLE\"}[$__range]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "id": 3
